  "synopsis": "Elementary schooler Tsubaki is head over heels for his childhood friend, Yuu, a gentle and easygoing high schooler. Though Yuu always treats him with care, he can't help but see Tsubaki as just a kid. But Tsubaki is determined—\"I'll grow up fast and make Yuu-nii happy!\" With youthful determination and an earnest heart, Tsubaki's love story is just beginning—a heartfelt tale of innocence, admiration, and the bonds that grow over time.\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
